{"id": "19564", "title": "2026年度公务员录用省市县乡四级联考进入体检人选和体检安排的公告", "sourceUrl": "http://www.hebpr.cn/zxzx/001001/20260428/1ZJKyKoRn7.html", "date": "2026-06-29", "source": "河北公共资源交易中心", "content": "<div>\n<p>\n<span>\n根据河北省202</span><span>6</span><span>年度公务员录用省市县乡四级联考工作安排，现就省数据和政务服务局机关四级联考招录体检有关事项通知如下：\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n<span>一、</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n体检人员\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n根据《河北省202</span><span>6</span><span>年度公务员录用省市县乡四级联考工作实施方案》有关</span><span>要求\n</span>\n<span>\n，按照考生综合成绩排名和职位招录计划，确定了如下进入体检范围人选：\n</span>\n</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<table class=\"bid-table\" style=\"width:496pt\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n序号\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n职位代码\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n招录计划\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n考生姓名\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n笔试准考证号\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n综合成绩\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n本职位排名\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1001059</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n孟天天\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>10111102022</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>76.54 </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n1\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>2</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1001060</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n卢钇伶\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>10110501910</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>75.57 </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n1\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>3</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1001061</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n赵天泽\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>10110500812</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>78.07 </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n1\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>4</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1001062</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>1</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n李雅宁\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>10114001420</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>76.57 </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>\n<span>\n1\n</span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>\n<span>\n二、体检</span><span>集合</span><span>时间和地点\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n时间\n</span>\n<span>\n：\n</span>\n<span>\n202</span><span>6</span><span>年4月30</span><span>日</span><span>7:</span><span>20\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n地点：\n</span>\n<span>\n河北省数据和政务服务局\n</span>\n<span>\n（\n</span>\n<span>\n石家庄市\n</span>\n<span>\n新华区\n</span>\n<span>\n石清路\n</span>\n<span>\n9号\n</span>\n<span>\n）\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n三、注意事项\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n1.考生需携带本人有效身份证、笔试准考证</span><span>、面试通知书和一张小二寸近期免冠照片</span><span>，按时到指定地点集合，经点名核验身份后由工作人员带领统一体检。未按规定参加体检的考生视为自愿放弃录用资格。\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n2.考生在体检前一日应注意清淡饮食、注意休息、避免饮酒或剧烈运动，体检当天早上须空腹。\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n3.体检过程中，考生有隐瞒病史、冒名顶替、弄虚作假、涂改资料等行为的，按照有关规定取消录用，情节严重的，依法追究相关法律责任。\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n4.体检按照《公务员录用体检通用标准（试行）》和《公务员录用体检特殊标准（试行）》规定的项目、标准进行。\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n联系电话：\n0311-66635572\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n河北省数据和政务服务局              \n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n202</span><span>6年</span><span>4月28日                  \n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p><div>\n<h3>附件:</h3>\n</div>\n</div>", "html": "", "method": "", "region": "河北", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [], "hasAttachment": false, "is_bidding": true}